41. Final Architectural Decision
The following decision is considered locked for V2:

The DataRepository is the authoritative owner of shared contract and timeframe data.

The repository is keyed by:

Raw data:
    contract

Processed data:
    (contract, timeframe)

Charts consume repository data.

Charts do not independently load workbook sheets.

Main dashboard charts and popup charts share the same repository.

The repository uses lazy loading and cache invalidation based on workbook changes.

Crosshair synchronization remains an independent subsystem.

Performance optimization proceeds from measured bottlenecks rather than speculative rewrites.

This architecture is the foundation for subsequent V2 development and should not require another architectural rewrite when additional contracts, layouts, timeframes, popups, or performance optimizations are added.
